      "_comment": "Phase 30: AI soldiers (server only) fill an online zombies game up to fillTo soldiers while there are fewer humans; each leaves when a human takes its place. They earn nothing and are never recorded. waveWeight: how much one counts as a player for wave size and boss health.",
      "fillTo": 3,
      "joinDelaySec": 6,
      "aimErrorDeg": 3.5,
      "reactionSec": 0.4,
      "turnDegPerSec": 320,
      "followDistance": 4.5,
      "waveWeight": 0.5
    }
  },
